From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 01:18:09 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 34/56] Fix column selection paste, tab widths and stale blocks

Paste any multi-line text line by line instead of inserting it with
its line breaks on every line. Measure inserted tabs from the column
they land on. Leave block mode on Ctrl+Backspace/Delete, which edit at
the single cursor. Draw only the visible rows of a block, take the
virtual column width from a glyph that is not a tab, and enable Cut and
Copy only for a block with width.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

